   "metric": "margin",
   "statement": "Titan Jewellery business margin target remains anchored around 11% for FY27.",
   "quote": "We would not, as far as FY27 is concerned, change our stance on margins. I think we still, Mihir, would like to anchor our margin target at around 11%.",
